      en: ["Houses the GL1Z LNG plant with a capacity of approximately 10.5 million tonnes per year.", "The Sorfert plant produces around 1.26 million tonnes of ammonia annually.", "The zone is located about 40 kilometers east of the city of Oran on the Mediterranean coast.", "Bethioua is directly connected to the Hassi R'Mel gas field via major pipelines.", "The Port of Arzew-Bethioua is one of the world's largest hydrocarbon export ports.", "Significant quantities of methanol are manufactured in the zone for industrial use."],
      es: ["Un enorme complejo industrial cerca de Arzew que procesa GNL, amoníaco y otros productos petroquímicos.", "Situada en el territorio de la República Argelina Democrática y Popular."],
