      en: ["Commercial production at Timimoun started in March 2018.", "The field has a capacity of approximately 1.6 billion cubic meters of gas per year.", "It includes a total of 37 production wells in the initial development phase.", "The gas is transported to Hassi R'Mel via the GR5 pipeline.", "Sonatrach holds a 51% stake in the development project.", "The Timimoun region is also famous for its traditional Foggara irrigation systems."],
